sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User Script / Notebook
    participant Registry as AlgorithmRegistry<br/>create_algorithm()
    participant Backend as Backend Implementation
    participant GPU as GPU Workers<br/>(torchrun / NCCL)
    participant vLLM as vLLM Inference<br/>(co-located, localhost)
    participant FS as Local Filesystem<br/>Checkpoints
    participant ExtAPI as External APIs<br/>W&B / MLflow / LiteLLM

    Note over User,ExtAPI: Flow 1: SFT / OSFT Training

    User->>Registry: sft(model, data, ...) / osft(...)
    Registry->>Backend: InstructLabTraining / MiniTrainer Backend
    Backend->>GPU: torchrun launch<br/>TCP (NCCL/Gloo)
    loop Training Loop
        GPU->>GPU: Forward / backward pass
        GPU->>FS: Save checkpoint<br/>File I/O (POSIX)
        opt Logging Enabled
            GPU->>ExtAPI: Log metrics<br/>HTTPS/443 (API Key)
        end
    end
    GPU-->>Backend: Training complete
    Backend-->>User: Output path + metrics

    Note over User,ExtAPI: Flow 2: LoRA+GRPO Training (ART Backend)

    User->>Registry: lora_grpo(model, data, reward_fn, ...)
    Registry->>Backend: ARTLoRAGRPOBackend
    Backend->>vLLM: Launch vLLM subprocess<br/>HTTP localhost
    loop GRPO Iterations
        Backend->>vLLM: Generate rollouts<br/>HTTP (no auth)
        vLLM-->>Backend: Completions
        Backend->>Backend: Evaluate rewards<br/>(tool_call_reward / binary)
        Backend->>GPU: Unsloth LoRA training step<br/>In-process
        Backend->>FS: Save LoRA adapter<br/>File I/O (POSIX)
    end
    Backend-->>User: Trained adapter path

    Note over User,ExtAPI: Flow 3: GEPA Prompt Optimization

    User->>Registry: gepa(task, eval_fn, ...)
    Registry->>Backend: GEPABackend / MLflowGEPABackend
    loop Evolutionary Search
        Backend->>ExtAPI: LLM evaluation calls<br/>HTTPS/443 (API Key via litellm)
        ExtAPI-->>Backend: LLM responses
        Backend->>Backend: Score candidates<br/>eval function
        Backend->>Backend: Evolve prompts<br/>mutation + crossover
    end
    Backend->>FS: Save optimized prompts<br/>File I/O
    Backend-->>User: Best prompt + score
